From: VyOS SRX kernel build
Subject: octeon: add missing octeon_send_ipi_single prototype

arch/mips/cavium-octeon/smp.c defines octeon_send_ipi_single with no prior
prototype, which breaks -Werror=missing-prototypes. Add the forward
declaration the shipping tree carries (vendor kernel smp.c)
immediately before the function's comment block.

